language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario ShareUiValue.
condition ShareUiValueReady.
condition ShareUiValueContinue.
condition ShareUiValueReject.
outcome ShareUiValueCompleted.
outcome ShareUiValueRejected.
step ShareUiValueCreate.
step ShareUiValueShare.
step ShareUiValueFormat.
step ShareUiValueRender.
step ShareUiValueFailure.
step ShareUiValueSuccess.

ShareUiValue illustrates ChangeUiPresentation.
ShareUiValue exercises StableUiContext.
ShareUiValue starts-when ShareUiValueReady.
ShareUiValue starts-at ShareUiValueCreate.
ShareUiValueReady describes "A Composition needs two views of the same semantic length.".
ShareUiValueContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
ShareUiValueReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
ShareUiValueCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
ShareUiValueRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
ShareUiValue preserves PreserveRepresentationIdentity.
ShareUiValue preserves ConservativeQuality.
ShareUiValueCreate calls CreateCompositionScope within BuckingUI.
ShareUiValueCreate describes "Allocate context-scoped semantic instance.".
ShareUiValueCreate proceeds-to ShareUiValueFailure when ShareUiValueReject.
ShareUiValueCreate proceeds-to ShareUiValueShare when ShareUiValueContinue.
ShareUiValueShare calls ShareRepresentationReferences within BuckingUI.
ShareUiValueShare describes "Two view references, one value/subscription.".
ShareUiValueShare proceeds-to ShareUiValueFailure when ShareUiValueReject.
ShareUiValueShare proceeds-to ShareUiValueFormat when ShareUiValueContinue.
ShareUiValueFormat calls FormatPresentationValue within BuckingUI.
ShareUiValueFormat describes "Different display units/precision without mutating source.".
ShareUiValueFormat proceeds-to ShareUiValueFailure when ShareUiValueReject.
ShareUiValueFormat proceeds-to ShareUiValueRender when ShareUiValueContinue.
ShareUiValueRender calls ReconcileViewNodes within BuckingUI.
ShareUiValueRender describes "Independent view handles and delivery cadence.".
ShareUiValueRender proceeds-to ShareUiValueFailure when ShareUiValueReject.
ShareUiValueRender proceeds-to ShareUiValueSuccess when ShareUiValueContinue.
ShareUiValueFailure finishes ShareUiValue with ShareUiValueRejected.
ShareUiValueSuccess finishes ShareUiValue with ShareUiValueCompleted.
